**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock is committed. This crate is embedded in a daemon that ships to a stand: the
# revision CI resolves has to be the revision the daemon gets.

# cargo-mutants writes its report here; the next run rotates the previous to `mutants.out.old`
# instead of deleting it, so the pattern covers both.
/mutants.out*
.metrics/
